    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x1AE0E7BE",
      "text": "<Alias=AliasFox> the fox is now available to be recruited as your pet!\r\n<Alias=AliasFox> can be commanded to lead you to nearby valuable items. <Alias=AliasFox> also has a chance to find a shiny item once per day.",
      "translated_text": "狐狸<Alias=AliasFox>现已成为可供招募的宠物！\r\n可向<Alias=AliasFox>下令将你带往周边的有价值物品处，<Alias=AliasFox>也可拿取某一件小物件，一天一次。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 56,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x44BA0D18",
      "text": "<Alias=AliasSpider> the spider is now available to be recruited as your pet!\r\n<Alias=AliasSpider> can be commanded to spin a sticky web trap to slow down your enemies. Potent venom can also be collected from <Alias=AliasSpider> once per day.",
      "translated_text": "蜘蛛<Alias=AliasSpider>现已成为可供招募的宠物！\r\n可向<Alias=AliasSpider>下令编织粘稠蛛网陷阱令敌人减速，也可从<Alias=AliasSpider>处收集强效毒液，一天一次。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 58,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0xE95DFD0A",
      "text": "<Alias=PetSpider> couldn't spin a web trap there...",
      "translated_text": "<Alias=PetSpider>无法在此编织蛛网陷阱……",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 62,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x28446A2E",
      "text": "<Alias=AliasGoat> the goat is now available to be recruited as your pet!\r\n<Alias=AliasGoat> can carry lots of items, and can be equipped with a pack to carry even more. A jug of milk can also be collected from <Alias=AliasGoat> once per day.",
      "translated_text": "山羊<Alias=AliasGoat>现已成为可供招募的宠物！\r\n<Alias=AliasGoat>可负载大量物品，装备行囊则可背负更多，也可从<Alias=AliasGoat>处挤奶，一天一次。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 63,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x92644E79",
      "text": "<Alias=PetFox> couldn't find anything...",
      "translated_text": "<Alias=PetFox>没找到任何东西……",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 67,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "QUST:CNAM",
      "form_id": "0xEBFC906A",
      "text": "Recruit stage",
      "translated_text": "Recruit stage",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 81,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "BOOK:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x60234A92",
      "text": "<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\" size=\"18\">\r\n<b>14th of Second Seed</b>\r\nThe rabbits here seem particularly adept at sniffing out potion ingredients. I recently found one nibbling on my thistle plants and managed to capture it. It is my hope that I will be able to train it to lead me to the most bountiful flora.\r\n\r\n<b>22nd of Second Seed</b>\r\nThe rabbit (which I have decided to name Thistle, in honor of the carefully cultivated plants it managed to destroy) is showing great promise. It has proven to be quite tame and even rather intelligent. Getting it to respond to commands, however, can be a bit of a trial. I've resorted to plying it with carrots. ",
      "translated_text": "<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\" size=\"18\">\r\n<b>次种月14日</b>\r\n这里的兔子似乎尤为擅长嗅探药水原材料。我最近便在我培植的蓟丛上找到一只正在大快朵颐的并成功将其捕获。但愿我能够将其训练至足以引导我前往最为丰富的植物群的水平。\r\n\r\n<b>次种月22日</b>\r\n那兔子（我决定将其命名为蓟花，以纪念其常识毁坏的精心栽培的植物）天赋秉异。事实证明，其温顺非凡，还相当聪明机智。然而，令其响应命令可能有些费工夫。我只得给它喂上些胡萝卜。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 83,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0xDA617CC2",
      "text": "<Alias=PetSpider> must be your companion in order to give it commands",
      "translated_text": "<Alias=PetSpider>必须追随你后方可对其下达命令。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 84,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "MESG:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x1D2B723A",
      "text": "<Alias=AliasSkeever> the skeever is now available to be recruited as your pet!\r\n<Alias=AliasSkeever> can be commanded to lead you to nearby food items. <Alias=AliasSkeever> also has a chance to find food once per day.",
      "translated_text": "恶鼠<Alias=AliasSkeever>现已成为可供招募的宠物！\r\n可向<Alias=AliasSkeever>下令将你带往周边的食物处，<Alias=AliasSkeever>也可拿取某一件食物，一天一次。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 100,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "BOOK:DESC",
      "form_id": "0xE8242867",
      "text": "<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\r\nWhile my siblings may be obsessed with the taste that fear imbues in the blood of mortals, I find that pain lends a much more potent sweetness. And nothing is quite so capable of causing pain as the venom of a frostbite spider.\r\n\r\nBut alas, the usual method of harvesting frostbite venom involves killing the spider - a costly and dangerous venture. Far too little venom can be obtained through violent methods for the experiments I wish to conduct. \r\n\r\nTo that end, I have captured a frostbite spider from deeper in the cave so that I may regularly collect its venom, which seems to be unusually potent. I discovered that it appears to have some measure of intelligence, and I have been attempting to teach it to obey certain orders. Oh how delicious it would be to have a tamed spider entangle my prey on command!\r\n\r\nI think I will name it Arachnia. ",
      "translated_text": "<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><div align=\"left\">\r\n虽然我的同族或许沉迷于恐惧在凡人血液中蔓延的味道，但我发现猎物痛觉缠身则味道更佳。没有什么比霜噬蜘蛛的毒液更能引起疼痛了。\r\n\r\n但可惜的是，收获霜噬毒液的常规方法是杀死蜘蛛——此法代价高昂且颇为冒险。对我打算进行的实验而言，通过暴力手段以获得的毒液可太少了。\r\n\r\n为此，我从洞穴深处捕获了一只霜噬蜘蛛，以便我可以定期自其收集颇有奇效的毒液。我发觉其似乎具有某种水平的智力，我一直尝试驯服其服从某些命令。诶呀，让一只驯化的蜘蛛按照命令缠住我的猎物便是极好的！\r\n\r\n我想将其命名为阿蛛。",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 117,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "BOOK:DESC",
      "form_id": "0x6DAC48FE",
      "text": "<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\r\n<font size=\"40\">For Sale</font>\r\n\r\nOne tamed mountain goat. Able to carry a hefty amount of weight to the Throat of the World and back again. Gives good milk. \r\n\r\nIf interested in purchasing, see Halvar in Rorikstead. \r\n\r\n- Halvar",
      "translated_text": "<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\r\n<font size=\"40\">待售</font>\r\n\r\n现有一只温驯山羊待售。其可负重驮物甚多至世界之喉，并安然返回，亦可产良奶。\r\n\r\n若有兴趣来购，请来洛利克镇与哈尔瓦商洽。\r\n\r\n哈尔瓦",
      "index": 1,
      "global_seq": 119,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "QUST:CNAM",
      "form_id": "0xEA1AE5E1",
      "text": "After reading Halvar's journal on his adventures throughout Skyrim, I've discovered that there are many other tame animal companions out there in the wild. I should set out to find them.",
      "translated_text": "读罢哈尔瓦天际旅途的日记，我了解到野外还有其它驯化的动物。我要出发寻找一番。",
      "index": 4,
      "global_seq": 126,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "QUST:CNAM",
      "form_id": "0xEA1AE5E1",
      "text": "I found a notice in the Bannered Mare offering a tamed goat for sale. I need to talk to Halvar in Rorikstead to purchase it.",
      "translated_text": "我在母马旗帜旅店看见一则驯化山羊待售的告示。我要去洛利克镇与哈尔瓦商洽购买事宜。",
      "index": 3,
      "global_seq": 128,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "QUST:CNAM",
      "form_id": "0xEA1AE5E1",
      "text": "The journey through Skyrim can be hard and long, and I could use the companionship of a loyal animal. I should inquire in town to see if there are any tamed animals for sale.",
      "translated_text": "游走天际是项漫长的苦差事，我在此期间可以驯化一些动物供我驱使。我要去城里看看有没有驯化的动物可供购买。",
      "index": 2,
      "global_seq": 169,
      "f2": ""
    },
    {
      "rec": "QUST:CNAM",
      "form_id": "0xEBFC906A",
      "text": "exit cage",
      "translated_text": "exit cage",
